=== IR BEFORE OPTIMIZATIONS ===
0000: T0 <-- P0 [ASSIGN]
0001: T1 <-- P0 [ASSIGN]
0002: T2 <-- T1 ADD #4
0003: T3 <-- T0***DEREF*** ADD T2***DEREF***
0004: RETURNVALUE T3
=== END IR BEFORE OPTIMIZATIONS ===
=== IR AFTER LOOP ROTATION ===
0000: T0 <-- P0 [ASSIGN]
0001: T1 <-- P0 [ASSIGN]
0002: T2 <-- T1 ADD #4
0003: T3 <-- T0***DEREF*** ADD T2***DEREF***
0004: RETURNVALUE T3
=== END IR AFTER LOOP ROTATION ===
=== IR AFTER OPTIMIZATIONS ===
0000: R1(T0) <-- R0(P0) [ASSIGN]
0001: R2(T1) <-- R0(P0) [ASSIGN]
0002: R0(T2) <-- R2(T1) ADD #4
0003: R2(T3) <-- R1(T0)***DEREF*** ADD R0(T2)***DEREF***
0004: RETURNVALUE R2(T3)
=== END IR AFTER OPTIMIZATIONS ===
